WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.350
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.350
Okay, so...

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:09.480
<b>Seton Academy Record 2        Why Females Put XXX in Their Mouths</b>

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:09.480
We're going to test you to see if 
you're good enough for the cooking club.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:11.990
Remember, you may be the pack's boss,

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.290
but the president of this club is Hino-san,

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:16.120
and after her comes me, the vice president!

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.250
If you can't cook something 
at least a little bit tasty,

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.980
you won't be allowed to join the club!

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.000
Good luck!

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:24.570
Okay! I'll—

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:25.370
I'll do my best!

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.380
Who are you?!

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>This is a school for animals, where all
 sorts of animals live together.</i>

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:40.890
<i>It is a sacred cage where constant 
battles between species</i>

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:47.000
<i>foster a spirit of survival of 
the fittest in all students,</i>

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.400
<i>and it is called...</i>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.030
<b>Seton
 Academy</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.340
<i>Seton Academy!</i>

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:27.650
<b>Unnatural interspecies relations are strictly forbidden!!</b>

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:37.660
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.780
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.070
Sorry for butting in.

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:28.740
I'm Komori Yukari, the koala.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:29.790
<b>Koala 
Marsupialia Diprotodontia Phascolarctidae Phascolarctos</b>

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:30.910
Koala?

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:34.210
Yes! I'd like to take the 
test for this club, too!

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:35.720
Huh? Why?

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:38.380
Because I want to study cooking, of course!

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:40.320
That's fine, right, Jin-kun?

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.710
I know it'd make me happy to have more members.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:43.940
Oh... Sure.

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:44.850
But...

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:48.260
I'm pretty sure koalas only eat eucalyptus.

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:50.780
That's exactly right.

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:54.480
We normally only eat a 
certain type of eucalyptus.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.610
From morning to night, it's all 
eucalyptus, eucalyptus, eucalyptus, eucalyptus.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.970
I mean, I like it. I like eucalyptus.

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.550
But I want to try different 
things sometimes.

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.120
I told my mom that, but...

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.380
This is our survival strategy!

00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:09.830
...is all she ever says.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:14.340
If I don't do something, I'll eat 
nothing but eucalyptus until I die.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.620
I can see how that would be stressful.

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:19.010
So you want to join the cooking 
club to try some different foods?

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.220
No!

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:23.220
I'm searching...

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.780
for something...

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.700
that I ate long ago!

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:28.720
Is this a food manga now?!

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:32.140
But it was so far back, 
I don't remember when it was.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:35.070
I can't even remember what food it was.

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:37.250
No one in your family knows, either?

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:40.610
I thought of that, so I asked my mom once.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.750
And she said...

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:46.030
Why are you asking about that?

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.650
...and wouldn't tell me, for some reason.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.850
Okay, I get it. You can take the test to—

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.380
Thank you!

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.880
She's really good with a knife!

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.220
Barely anything's going in!

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:05.050
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:05.050
<b>* They made her wash them off</b>

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.680
Measure the amounts!

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.270
She's backed way off now.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.150
I guess she's afraid of fire.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:21.440
It's done! My special eucalyptus pasta!

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.200
You ended up using eucalyptus anyway?!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.280
This is good!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:30.670
I can't believe it... It's good.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:32.710
<b>* It's said that applying heat prevents the growth of the hydrogen cyanide
 that makes eucalyptus toxic, but still, never try this at home!</b>

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.710
Don't you want some, Ranka-san?

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.250
W-Wolves don't accept charity from—

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.540
Just eat it!

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.500
So Yukari-chan passes!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.940
Y-Yeah, I guess so.

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:44.470
<i>Damn! The point of this test 
was to keep everyone else out!</i>

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.430
Banzai! Banzai!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.990
<i>Oh, fine. As long as that stupid dog isn't here.</i>

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:50.110
Okay, now it's Ranka-chan's turn!

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:50.810
Huh?!

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.530
H-Hino-san, why her?

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:56.060
Well, she doesn't have any experience, 
so we'll need to help her.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.820
<i>It won't be a test at all, then.</i>

00:04:58.820 --> 00:04:59.690
Hey, Jin...

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.940
Do you think I can do this?

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:06.820
You can if you do exactly as I say.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.080
First, rinse off the vegetables.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.330
Got it!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.610
I washed it!

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:14.870
Don't use soap!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.120
Whatever. Now bring the meat over.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:17.580
Right!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.040
I brought the meat!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.130
Not in your mouth!

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:27.590
Why does Ranka-san want 
to join the cooking club?

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.140
Huh?

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:33.640
Hmm... Because she's Jin-kun's... 
and my boss, I guess?

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.890
You're all friends, then!

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:37.850
But are you sure you don't mind?

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.480
She's taking your male.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.650
She's taking your male.

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:45.930
I mean, there are no other 
humans at this school,

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:48.760
so I thought you two were a couple.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:51.660
Not at all! We're not like that at all!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.320
Jin-kun is just my friend!

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:56.280
He's absolutely, positively not my boyfriend!

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:57.620
Why are you crying?

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.060
Cutting onions makes me tear up!

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:00.920
Oh...

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.260
So the two of them are an 
interspecies couple, then?

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:08.130
That can't be easy, 
so we should cheer them on!

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:09.630
<i>I take it back!</i>

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.890
<i>I'll keep that stupid koala out 
of the club if it kills me!</i>

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:13.330
What's wrong?

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:15.890
Dumb dog...

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:20.190
You can handle the rest however you like!

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:23.210
Huh?! But if you don't tell me what to do...

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.320
Love!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.010
Cooking is about love.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:28.410
If you make it with love, it'll taste good!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:30.450
Love...

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.880
You can do it! I know you can!

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.410
Okay! I'll try!

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.900
Thanks, Jin!

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:48.100
Dinner is served!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:51.680
It's my special "Ranka's Love"!

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:53.150
Love?

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:57.180
Th-This smell... It's totally po—

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:57.680
It's love.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:02.600
By the way, you seem to 
be mistaken, little koala.

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:06.830
When you passed earlier, we only 
meant you cleared the first test.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:07.360
Huh?!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.430
If you want to join the club...

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:11.200
You have to eat all of this!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.210
Why?!

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:13.120
Jin-kun?!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.520
We all cook for each other here.

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:18.620
A picky eater has no place in this club!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:22.060
If you can't eat that, the results 
of the previous test will be—

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:22.960
Jin!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:25.460
Open wide!

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:27.840
What are you trying to do?

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.410
I filled this with my love for you!

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:32.090
So open wide!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.210
I will not!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:36.600
<i>This is definitely something 
no one should eat.</i>

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:40.980
<i>Hitomi-san isn't even eating any. 
She's just taking pictures.</i>

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:44.000
<i>But... I wonder why...</i>

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.990
<i>For some reason, it feels familiar.</i>

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:51.360
Hey! Don't!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.490
You'll die!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.710
This is it!

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.300
This is the dish I've been searching for!

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:05.790
I'm almost positive it's not!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.040
No, it is!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:10.550
This flavor... I've tasted it somewhere before.

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:15.550
<i>Koalas have bacteria in their bodies 
that allow them to digest toxic eucalyptus.</i>

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.920
<i>But they aren't born with it.</i>

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:22.180
<i>Shortly after birth, baby koalas 
eat undigested eucalyptus,</i>

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:25.120
<i>called "pap," directly from their mother's anus.</i>

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.440
<i>That's how they acquire this bacteria.</i>

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:32.250
<i>Yes, undigested eucalyptus 
from their mother's anus!</i>

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:36.910
<i>By the way, baby pandas also eat 
their mothers' undigested bamboo.</i>

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.660
I finally remember.

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:44.540
It was... from my mom's butt.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.440
Hey! Are you okay?!

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:46.340
Here!

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:52.530
No! My love!

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:53.700
Enough! Stay away from me!

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.980
If you like it, Yukari-chan, 
that means Ranka-chan passes, too.

00:08:56.980 --> 00:09:00.310
Hitomi-san, you'd better eat 
some before I finish it off!

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:03.120
Here! Don't be shy! Eat! Eat!

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:03.680
Um...

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:07.190
Please, eat it quickly!

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:14.630
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:15.850
<i>Koala!</i>

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.620
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.950
<i>Two-toed sloth!</i>

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:26.250
We need someone to give us vegetables?

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:29.910
Our budget is small, so we can't 
supply all the ingredients.

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:31.590
Do you know someone who can help?

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:35.570
Yeah. I heard the gardening club is 
handing out the food they've grown,

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:39.800
so I was thinking we could ask 
them to share some with us.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.490
Yeah. Good idea.

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:42.560
Good idea!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:43.630
Good idea!

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:44.310
Good idea!

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:46.750
Who are you?!

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:48.560
Oh! I know you!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.340
You were chosen as Miss Female at Seton Academy

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.740
Middle School for three years in a row!

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:54.570
I'm Nekomai Kurumi!

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:57.320
And what does Miss Female want with us?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.820
Do you wanna join our pack?

00:09:59.410 --> 00:09:59.820
Huh?!

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.830
But if you do, there's a very tough test to—

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.280
We're not doing that anymore!

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:05.330
What?!

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:08.140
If you have any interest in our club at all...

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.250
Of course not!

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:12.090
That doesn't interest meow at all!

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:13.960
Look!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.770
If you're just window shopping, get out!

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:19.260
Aw, I can take just a little peek, can't I?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.020
Can't I?

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:23.490
<i>Cats produce several different 
types of purrs from their throats.</i>

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:26.860
<i>One of them is the unusually 
high-frequency "solicitation purr,"</i>

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:31.620
<i>which is said to awaken nurturing 
instincts in mammals.</i>

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.560
Look, just go away alrea—

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:37.010
You're welcome to just watch.

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:40.330
We can't refuse a request
from the school idol.

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:40.950
Huh?!

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:43.490
Hey, Jin, what's going on?

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.790
Everyone's suddenly being all nice to her!

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:49.170
Do you all prefer cats?! Tell me, Jin!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.590
Sorry, but I can't give you any vegetables.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:58.910
Why not?!

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:01.660
Our crops have suddenly started yielding less.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:02.940
They have?

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.560
I think some idiot has been stealing our crops.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:06.980
Who would do that?

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:09.270
Boars have very poor eyesight.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:12.020
It wasn't you guys, was it?

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:14.540
A proud wolf would never do that!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:15.670
Is that so?!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.330
Let's just come back at night 
and take some in secret.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:20.950
What happened to your pride as a wolf?!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.260
Now what are we going to do?

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:30.910
Please share some vegetables 
with us, meow!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.140
Um... but... fmumff...

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:34.920
Take these!

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.300
There's lots!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.880
We can pick as much as we want 
without the prez seeing us!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:39.920
Hey!

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.180
It was you two?!

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.890
They said we could have these.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:46.700
I can see why you were 
Miss Female three years in a row!

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:48.180
Thanks, Kurumi-chan!

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:57.400
You're good at that, Kurumi-chan!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.700
So fast! Like I'd expect from a cat!

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:02.740
You're welcome to pet my 
well-groomed hair if you like.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:07.000
Th-They're relying on her more than me!

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:11.000
<i>Canines lick their front 
feet as a sign of stress.</i>

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.650
Hey, I'm bored of cooking.

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:19.820
Then leave!

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:22.970
Hey, Jin-kun, are you Ranka-chan's boyfriend?

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.860
Like hell I am! Who'd
go out with that dumb dog?

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:31.690
What'd you do that for?

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.780
It's how cats say hello, meow!

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:36.310
Hey, everyone! I have a suggestion, meow!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:37.890
What's up, Kurumi-chan?

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:39.060
What is it?

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:42.180
Well, why don't you all quit this club

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:44.240
and start a napping club with me?

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:48.590
Cooking's just a lot of hard work, right?

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:52.690
Starting a napping club with 
me would be a lot more fun!

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.110
Jin-kun agrees with me! Don't you?

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.420
I do not.

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:01.380
Sorry, Kurumi-chan.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.230
We can't do that.

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:06.010
We all love cooking!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.640
What?!

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.470
You heard them.

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:10.640
But why?!

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:11.790
Give it up.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:15.480
There are some times when you can't have 
your way, no matter how much you purr.

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:19.090
If you want to take naps, go off and 
take one somewhere on your own.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:24.020
You were trying to take over my 
pack from the start, weren't you?!

00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:25.740
Hmph! Fine, then!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:29.540
I was just joking around, anyway! 
Just killing some time!

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:32.290
I don't even want to join this stupid club!

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:39.650
Hanging out in packs is so lame.

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:43.510
There goes a potential new member.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.670
Hino-san...

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:47.220
I'm sure we'll find more soon.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.400
Yeah...

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:50.930
<i>It'd be fine with me if we didn't, though.</i>

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:56.850
Jin! I found a new member for the club!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.980
So early in the morning? Gross.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:02.340
I get it! I get it! So bring them here already!

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.360
That's a corpse!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.100
She's not a corpse! She's Miyubi!

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:12.100
Looks like she's on death's door to me.

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:13.860
She's got moss growing on her.

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:15.530
Huh? What's that?

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.420
She said this moss is her lunch!

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:25.130
She survives by eating some 
whenever she's hungry!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.460
I get it.

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:29.430
So she's a sloth, right?

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:32.770
<i>The slowest mammals in the world,</i>

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:35.170
<i>sloths only eat five grams of leaves per day,</i>

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:37.790
<i>and occasionally eat the moss 
that grows on their bodies.</i>

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:41.440
<i>Also, even though they're mammals, 
they're poikilothermic.</i>

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:42.770
She can join, right?!

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.150
Nope.

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:47.040
Wh-Why not?

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.470
It should be obvious. She's...

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.870
This is perfect.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:56.960
Miyubi-kun always stays in the 
classroom after school's out.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:15:04.250
<b>Seton Academy Headmaster 
Aramoto-sensei 
Alamosaurus</b>

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:58.540
It's a bit of a problem.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:02.500
You're her friends, so why don't 
you take her to the dorm?

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.250
Uh, we're not her friends...

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:06.780
Would you rather be stepped on?

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:10.650
All right, fine! We'll take her!

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:12.010
Jeez...

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.710
Miyubi, let's go!

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:15.780
Come on, let's get moving.

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:25.810
<i>They move at speeds of 180 meters per hour.</i>

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:27.400
<b>8x Speed</b>

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:29.110
<i>That's slower than turtles 
and even rhinoceros beetles!</i>

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.940
This'll take all night!

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:34.910
<i>And when they move too much, 
they generate so much heat that...</i>

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:37.610
<i>They die!</i>

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:40.910
<b>Die!</b>

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:38.780
<i>They die!</i>

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:39.600
Miyubi!

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:40.910
All she did was walk!

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.260
Sheesh... I'll just carry you.

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:44.420
But only this once!

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.280
I think we've got the wrong room.

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:58.140
She said she's been looking 
for a sport she's good at.

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.270
I don't think she'll find one!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.270
Okay, later.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.020
I'm outta here.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.330
Wait, Jin!

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:07.820
Help me carry Miyubi to our club room tomorrow.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.550
Listen...

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:13.030
She doesn't eat anything but 
five grams of leaves per day.

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:14.660
Five grams?

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:18.910
You think someone who can't even eat 
has any place in a cooking club?

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.900
If we force her, she'll just be miserable.

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:22.980
Give it up.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.580
Fine! I won't ask for your help!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.950
Seriously, would you just—

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.860
Okay, arms up!

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.850
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:34.510
She said she wanted a bath when 
she got back to the dorm.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.760
So I'm going to give her one!

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:40.850
<i>Why the hell am I blushing?</i>

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.070
<i>Like I care about an animal's naked body.</i>

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:44.810
Oh, there's no soap!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.480
I'll go get some.

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:48.550
Watch Miyubi for me!

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:50.010
Hey!

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:54.240
Fine, do what you want. 
But I'm not helping, you hear?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:58.430
<i>Sloths are unusual in that they 
are poikilothermic mammals.</i>

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:00.330
<i>In a bath, they will overheat...</i>

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:01.540
<i>and die!</i>

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:02.120
<i>and die!</i>

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:03.620
Then don't take baths!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.080
Oh, damn it! Fine!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.340
I have no choice.

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:18.290
Don't die! Don't die!

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:30.670
I'm really leaving this time, all right?

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:35.320
<b>8x Speed</b>

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:38.320
Wh-What?

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:46.680
<b>8x Speed</b>

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:50.680
For me?

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:54.510
As... thanks.

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.800
For saving you from the bath?

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:58.550
No.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:03.560
For letting me... join your... club.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.810
Uh, but I didn't...

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:07.790
Ranka-chan said...

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:11.640
If you don't have any friends, 
join the cooking club!

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:15.150
I know you might be nervous about 
joining a club started by humans,

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.900
but Jin and the rest of them are super nice!

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:20.370
I was always alone, too,

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:23.660
but thanks to Jin, I'm having lots of fun now!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.910
W-Well, she's been nothing 
but a hassle to me!

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:34.090
I was... always... alone... before.

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:37.420
So I'm... happy.

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:41.950
<i>When sloths move too much, 
they become exhausted...</i>

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:42.800
<i>and die!</i>

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:44.930
<b>Die!</b>

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:43.420
<i>and die!</i>

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:44.930
All you did was make tea!

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:47.560
I brought some soap!

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:48.950
Huh? Jin?

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:51.120
You brought Hino-san, too?

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:53.520
You gave Miyubi her bath!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.980
Just with water, since there was no soap.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:19:00.570
You just couldn't help yourself when 
you saw Miyubi-san naked, huh?

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.490
Don't be misleading like that!

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:06.380
Listen, Jin... About Miyubi...

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:07.750
It's fine.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:09.840
If you want her in the club, she can join.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:12.970
It'd make Hino-san happy to 
have more members, anyway.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.660
Yeah! You're more than welcome!

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:19.880
Yay! I'm so happy for you, Miyubi!

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.770
And that just leaves you.

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:30.440
You're getting annoying. 
Just show yourself already.

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:32.350
Kurumi-chan?

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:37.480
I-I was passing by and I heard voices, 
so I came to see what was up, that's all!

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:40.160
Well, I think I'll go take a nap now!

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:42.490
You actually want to be part 
of the group, don't you?

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:45.240
Wh-What are you talking about?! I don't—

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.530
Your tail.

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:49.660
Your tail's telling everyone 
how you really feel!

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.290
It's been straight up all this time!

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:53.040
<b>* A cat holds its tail straight up as an expression
\h\h of affection when it is happy or wants attention.</b>

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.860
That's how you felt, Kurumi-chan?

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:58.630
Is it true that there's coffee
 made from cat poop?

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.300
I-I'm...

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:04.340
We have a koala who's sick of 
eucalyptus, a sloth who likes sports,

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:06.930
and a wolf who wants to form a pack with humans.

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:10.560
Having an attention-seeking 
cat around won't change much.

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:16.390
The truth is, ever since the 
first time I saw all of you,

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:18.000
I envied you.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:22.690
Yeah, right! I never felt that way at all!

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:25.450
A-And I don't want any friends, either!

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.700
And I don't want to join
your silly cooking club!

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.340
Kurumi-chan...

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:39.230
Jin, what should we do about the vegetables?

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:41.870
Kurumi-san is gone, too.

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:43.720
Everyone!

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.820
So many vegetables!

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.530
Hino-san, are these...

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:53.650
The gardening club president said 
we get first dibs from now on.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:54.850
Wow!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.730
We can cook lots of things with all these!

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:59.780
Jin-kun, I guess we got one more new member.

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:00.730
Huh?

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:04.490
That cat...

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:07.990
The curry packed with vegetables is ready!

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:10.650
Let's eat!

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:17.580
<i>When sloths eat foods they aren't used to,</i>

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:19.600
<i>they can't digest it... so they die!</i>

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:19.940
<i>they die!</i>

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:21.180
Miyubi!

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:22.840
Oh, just let her die already!

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:25.330
Are you all right?!

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:26.340
What are we supposed to do?!

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:28.180
Hang in there!

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:57.390
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:21:57.770 --> 00:21:59.400
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:08.440
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:23:08.770 --> 00:23:10.770
Let's eat!

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:16.410
The cooking club is encouraging 
unnatural interspecies relations.

00:23:17.310 --> 00:23:21.210
No mercy need be shown to those 
who disturb the school ecosystem.

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:23.330
Their club will be disbanded!

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:25.520
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:25.520 --> 00:23:25.980
<b>Yukari here!</b>

00:23:25.980 --> 00:23:26.770
<b>Kurumi here!</b>

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:27.380
<b>Mi......</b>

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:28.880
<b>The student council wants to break up our cooking club!</b>

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:29.400
<b>yu......</b>

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:31.490
<b>And there's a lion who's crazy about an impala!</b>

00:23:31.490 --> 00:23:32.070
<b>bi......</b>

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:32.860
<b>That's the story.</b>

00:23:32.860 --> 00:23:35.410
<b>It'll be an episode full of love and hate, meow!</b>

00:23:35.410 --> 00:23:37.030
<b>I bet things are gonna get messy......!</b>

00:23:37.030 --> 00:23:37.470
<b>here......</b>

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:38.490
<b>Don't miss it!</b>

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 3</b>

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Those Who Strip with the Ones They Love</b>
